        "original_id": "76d43300-5bf7-5a6f-8051-0c826ef60b90",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Greg Puciato, Syd Barrett\n- Bands: The Dillinger Escape Plan, The Black Queen, Killer Be Killed, Pink Floyd, Error\n- Roles: lead singer, guitarist, principal songwriter, vocalist\n- Products: Error EP\n\nFacts:\n- Greg Puciato was born on March 27, 1980.\n- Syd Barrett was a founder member of Pink Floyd and served as its lead singer, guitarist, and principal songwriter in the band’s early years.\n- Syd Barrett is credited with naming Pink Floyd.\n- Greg Puciato is the lead singer of The Dillinger Escape Plan, The Black Queen, and Killer Be Killed.\n- Greg Puciato is known for reckless live performances, a wide vocal range, and outspoken views.\n- Greg Puciato has caused controversy through both performances and interviews.\n- Greg Puciato, although not an official member of Error, was asked to record vocals for the Error EP because the band lacked a vocalist at the time.",
